WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:11.425
On the XRP Ledger, if an account holds the same currency on two trust lines without the NoRipple flag, anyone's payment can move value between them.

2
00:00:11.433 --> 00:00:17.600
No signature from the account is needed. Most teams never check. This page does it for free.

3
00:00:18.723 --> 00:00:23.909
Enter any public account. Here, a token issuer that published its own address.

4
00:00:31.152 --> 00:00:36.466
The verdict, the account's role, the ledger it was read at, and how many trust lines were read.

5
00:00:37.872 --> 00:00:49.031
Per currency: what is held, how much room other lines have, and what could move. When something is exposed, the unsigned fix appears below, ready for your own signing process.

6
00:00:50.037 --> 00:00:57.292
The check is free. Paid plans add fleet scans of every wallet you run, and holder scans for token issuers.

7
00:00:57.298 --> 00:01:03.487
Plans run from two hundred and ninety-nine to three thousand five hundred dollars a month, all read-only.

8
00:01:04.495 --> 00:01:09.404
The research note shows how common this is on Mainnet, without naming any account.
